  AIWaypointPatrolUniversalPrefab: {fileID: 1306400898847166, guid: 559e53f18cc9ecc48b243faf4762d6dd,
    type: 3}
  mainAIWaypointPatrol: {fileID: 0}
  explanation: 'The button ''Add Patrol System to AI'' will add a custom patrol to
    this character.


    The button ''Assign AI Waypoint Patrol'' will search for
    any previous patrol on scene to assign it to this AI.


    So that allows that
    2 AI share the same patrol. You can also drop a specific patrol from the scene
    on the field Main AI Waypoint Patrol and it will that the patrol assigned to
    the character.


    Finally, use the buttons Enable or Disable patrol to set
    that state on start on the AI.'
